                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "St. Elmo's fire",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abeb51ba-425c-39da-91f6-a885c341113c",
                                        "entry_id": "e0a6d000-a7bf-3d30-91a6-efaf2ee9d70a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An electrical discharge, or corona, seen around pointed objects, caused by ionization of the atmosphere during storms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5dd1dc2-45c0-4cb0-a993-1b6f558cdb26",
                                                "sense_id": "abeb51ba-425c-39da-91f6-a885c341113c",
                                                "text": "I can see a new horizon, underneath a blazing sky.\nI’ll be where the eagle’s flying, higher and higher!\nGonna be a man in motion, all I need is a pair of wheels.\nTake me where the future lies, in St. Elmo’s fire!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d29a668-5e17-47a0-af96-c3b2af08afab",
                        "source_entry_id": "40bc0b1b-e8c8-3db7-810d-45f37a4dc573",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bda811a-4dc2-3cd2-9b83-02e00042b4a3",
                        "source_sense_description": "elektrische Lichterscheinung, die bei gewittriger Lage an hohen, spitzen Gegenständen auftritt",
                        "target_lang_word": "corposant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "corposant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e30428d8-5b21-3951-9172-a5f06fa863b7",
                                        "entry_id": "dab81375-e126-32f3-9300-535217a67c59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An electrical discharge accompanied by a corona of ionization in the surrounding atmosphere"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d80d7ee-ce3c-4cc1-9c68-cf3fd30e9fa9",
                                                "sense_id": "e30428d8-5b21-3951-9172-a5f06fa863b7",
                                                "text": "I said the corpusants have mercy on us all; and I hope they will, still. But do they only have mercy on long faces?--have they no bowels for a laugh? […] I take that mast-head flame we saw for a sign of good luck; for those masts are rooted in a hold that is going to be chock a' block with sperm-oil, d'ye see; and so, all that sperm will work up into the masts, like sap in a tree. Yes, our three masts will yet be as three spermaceti candles--that's the good promise we saw."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d6d5d77-61e9-4855-a9c9-89f362cefa74",
                                                "sense_id": "e30428d8-5b21-3951-9172-a5f06fa863b7",
                                                "text": "If there was a sharp point nearby, electricity would stream from it in a luminous brush, a little corposant, and one could blow out candles with the outstreaming “electric wind,” or even get this to turn a little rotor on its pivot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2dd56226-8e53-486c-92a5-c26bfe5cfc1d",
                        "source_entry_id": "40bc0b1b-e8c8-3db7-810d-45f37a4dc573",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bda811a-4dc2-3cd2-9b83-02e00042b4a3",
